      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "<p>Blast away at Emperor Zurg’s abominable bot army in an all-out battle to save Planet Pepperonia!</p>",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "Blast away at Emperor Zurg’s abominable bot army in an all-out battle to save Planet Pepperonia! "
      },
      "entityCards": [
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "The Gamma Quadrant Needs You",
              "text": "<p>Go from zero to Space Ranger hero—join Buzz on an interactive galactic adventure to stop Star Command’s most wanted!</p>\n<p>Ready to wreak cosmic chaos, evil Emperor Zurg has returned to demolish the Space Aliens’ planet with a crystal-powered Superblaster. It’s up to you to infiltrate Zurg’s secret lair, neutralize his army of underlings and eliminate the weapon of “mass alien destruction” before it’s too late!</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-buzz-lightyear-planet-rescue-01-new_tcm1871-114792.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Serve and Protect",
              "text": "<p>Take aim as your call of duty begins—the fate of the Space Aliens’ home is in your hands! After a briefing with Buzz, board your ship and head to Zurg’s hideout armed with red and green pulse blasters that’ll help block interstellar attacks along the way.</p>\n<p>Once you spot the “Power Source Z’s” on Zurg’s guards, fire away to accumulate points for each target hit. The more points scored, the faster you rise through the ranks of Buzz’s elite squadron.</p>\n<p>From surviving fighter ships and a siege of Sentry Bots to maneuvering through a maze of corridors and unearthing the crystal mines, Buzz and his crew continue to converge on Zurg and ultimately destroy the Superblaster—mission accomplished!</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-buzz-lightyear-planet-rescue-02-new_tcm1871-114793.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Blasting Off the Big Screen ",
              "text": "<p>Andy’s superstar Space Ranger headlines a new quest that takes intergalactic greatness to infinity and beyond! Inspired by characters from the hit Disney•Pixar <em>Toy Story</em> films as well as the animated television series, Buzz Lightyear, Emperor Zurg and those lovable little aliens have returned for their next big adventure—and it’s filled with blasters, bots and pure planetary pandemonium.</p>\n<p>The attraction is based on the popularity of Buzz Lightyear’s Space Ranger Spin, which opened in Magic Kingdom park at Walt Disney World Resort in Florida in 1998. Other versions can be found in Tokyo Disneyland, Disneyland Paris, Hong Kong Disneyland and Disneyland Resort in California.</p>\n<p>Disneyland is the only Disney theme park to feature a version of the attraction where Buzz and his buddies are not referred to as toys and completely live within their astro-blasting “world.”</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-buzz-lightyear-planet-rescue-03-new_tcm1871-114794.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
